nutritional intake.", "ENOBOSARM:Enobosarm is a selective androgen receptor modulator currently in phase II studies, showing promise in increasing lean mass and strength.", "DRONABINOL:Dronabinol is a synthetic form of THC used in the US as an appetite stimulant and antiemetic, with psychoactive properties.", "GRELINA:Grelina is a hormone that has shown to increase appetite in healthy individuals and cancer patients but is not commercially available due to its short half-life.", "ANAMORELINA:Anamorelina is a ghrelin analog that has demonstrated improvements in appetite, body weight, and lean mass in phase III studies, though it is not yet available.", "PACIENTE ONCOLÓGICO:The \"PACIENTE ONCOLÓGICO\" refers to an adult cancer patient who is undergoing treatment for cancer. This individual may experience nutritional deficiencies or malnutrition as a result of the disease and its associated treatments. Due to these challenges, the oncological patient often requires nutritional support to help maintain their health and well-being throughout the treatment process.", "CÁNCER PULMONAR:El cáncer pulmonar es un tipo de cáncer que también puede aumentar el gasto energético en reposo de los pacientes.", "DIETA TRADICIONAL:La dieta tradicional es la alimentación habitual que se modifica para mejorar la nutrición de los pacientes oncológicos.", "SUPLEMENTOS DE ISOFLAVONAS:Los suplementos que contienen isoflavonas no se aconsejan para pacientes oncológicos debido a su contenido elevado en comparación con la dieta.", "DERIVADOS DE SOJA:Los derivados de soja son productos que no se pueden recomendar actualmente para pacientes oncológicos debido a la falta de información sobre sus interacciones.", "LESLER M:Lesler M is an author of the work titled 'Oncology Nutrition for Clinical Practice' published in 2013, which discusses nutritional needs for cancer patients.", "ONCOLOGY NUTRITION FOR CLINICAL PRACTICE:A publication that provides guidelines and recommendations for nutritional support in oncology patients."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}